{"seq":2,"slug":"buffer-windows","title":"缓冲时间窗：让输入有保质期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-input-buffering-systems/buffering/buffer-windows","wordCount":1568,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"缓冲时间窗-让输入有保质期\">缓冲时间窗：让输入有保质期</h1><p>队列负责装载输入，但真正决定「一个早到的按键能等多久」的是时间窗。窗口太短，等于没缓冲；太长，一秒前的跳跃会诡异地生效。时间窗是缓冲系统里最直接影响手感、也最需要逐动作打磨的参数。本篇讲窗口该用什么单位度量、何时过期、为何不同动作要用不同长度，并给出跳跃缓冲这一最常见窗口的经验取值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一个滑动的有效期\">核心概念：一个滑动的有效期</h2><p>缓冲时间窗是附着在每条输入事件上的有效期。设事件在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 进入队列、窗口时长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，则该事件在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_0, t_0 + W]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 内有效；一旦当前时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t - t_0 &gt; W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，无论是否被消费，它都作废并被 <code>tick</code> 清理。判定「窗口内是否存在可消费输入」就是在问：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>e</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exists\\, e:\\ (t - e.timestamp \\le W)\\ \\wedge\\ \\neg e.consumed\\ \\wedge\\ e.action = a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">am</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>窗口的作用方向要分清。<strong>跳跃缓冲</strong>这类窗口是「向未来延伸」——玩家早按，输入等着条件成熟（落地）再触发。而<a href=\"../leniency/coyote-time\">土狼时间</a>那类窗口是「向过去延伸」——条件（在地面）刚失效，但仍允许在其后一小段时间内触发。二者对称互补：一个宽容「输入来早了」，一个宽容「条件走早了」，合起来把落地起跳的判定在时间轴上向两侧各撑开一点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[按下跳跃 t0] --&gt; B[事件入队, 起有效期 W]&#10;  B --&gt; C{每帧检查条件}&#10;  C --&gt;|未落地 且 t - t0 小于等于 W| D[继续等待]&#10;  D --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt;|落地 且 仍在窗内| E[消费并起跳]&#10;  C --&gt;|t - t0 大于 W 仍未落地| F[窗口过期, 输入作废]&#10;  E --&gt; G[标记 consumed]\">flowchart TD\n  A[按下跳跃 t0] --&gt; B[事件入队, 起有效期 W]\n  B --&gt; C{每帧检查条件}\n  C --&gt;|未落地 且 t - t0 小于等于 W| D[继续等待]\n  D --&gt; C\n  C --&gt;|落地 且 仍在窗内| E[消费并起跳]\n  C --&gt;|t - t0 大于 W 仍未落地| F[窗口过期, 输入作废]\n  E --&gt; G[标记 consumed]</pre><h2 id=\"帧还是秒-单位之争\">帧还是秒：单位之争</h2><p>窗口可以用帧数（如「10 帧」）或时间（如「0.15 秒」）表达，选择关乎正确性。</p>\n<p>用<strong>帧</strong>表达简单直观，且天然对齐固定步长——格斗游戏几乎都用帧，因为它们的整个战斗系统都以帧为时间原子（起手 8 帧、恢复 12 帧）。但帧数只有在固定步长下才有稳定含义；若你的缓冲逻辑不慎跑在可变渲染帧里，「10 帧」的真实时长会随帧率乱漂。用<strong>秒</strong>表达则与帧率解耦，更适合帧率不锁定的游戏，代价是每次判定要做时间比较、且要注意浮点累积误差。</p>\n<p>务实的结论：<strong>在固定步长里用帧、把秒作为对外配置</strong>。设计师用「0.13 秒」思考并填表，系统在固定步长下换算成帧来判定（60 FPS 下约 8 帧）。这样既有直观的时间语义，又有确定性的判定基础。这层换算与固定步长的关系，<a href=\"input-queue\">输入队列</a>已铺垫，<a href=\"../practice/input-buffering-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>会进一步谈可变帧率下的处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一动作一窗-为何不能全局一个值\">一动作一窗：为何不能全局一个值</h2><p>新手常犯的错是给所有输入设一个统一缓冲窗。这会立刻撞上响应与宽容的张力（见<a href=\"../foundations/responsive-vs-forgiving\">响应与宽容之衡</a>）：不同动作在轴上的理想位置根本不同。</p>\n<p>跳跃是高频、低风险、可逆性强的动作，误触发一次只是多跳一下，值得给较长的窗以求跟手。而消耗资源的大招是低频、高风险动作，缓冲窗必须短——你绝不希望玩家两秒前的一次误碰在此刻放掉了大招。攻击介于两者之间。因此成熟系统给每个动作单独配窗：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作类别</th>\n<th>典型窗口（60 FPS 参考）</th>\n<th>偏向</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>跳跃</td>\n<td>约 6–10 帧（0.1–0.17 s）</td>\n<td>宽容</td>\n<td>高频、误触发无害、极需跟手</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闪避/翻滚</td>\n<td>约 5–8 帧</td>\n<td>略宽容</td>\n<td>高频，但需防连续误触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>普通攻击 / 连招衔接</td>\n<td>约 6–12 帧</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>连段流畅性所需，见取消窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消耗型大招</td>\n<td>约 2–4 帧或不缓冲</td>\n<td>响应</td>\n<td>低频高风险，防误放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搓招指令（方向序列）</td>\n<td>每步约 8–12 帧</td>\n<td>视流派</td>\n<td>见预输入与宽容度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表中格斗游戏的方向序列窗有真实参照：据对《街头霸王 6》输入系统的社区拆解（WydD），其四分之一圈（QCF）的方向缓冲约为 11 帧，半圈从旧作的 8 帧放宽到 12 帧，360 度全圈从 25 帧放宽到 32 帧——越复杂的指令给越长的容错，这套逐指令配窗的思路正是本节主张的极致体现，具体判定归 <a href=\"../leniency/input-leniency\">预输入与宽容度</a> 展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过期与清理-别让旧输入还魂\">过期与清理：别让旧输入还魂</h2><p>窗口的另一半是过期处理，做不好会制造最诡异的 bug。两个纪律：</p>\n<p>其一，<strong>过期即清</strong>。<code>tick</code> 每步扫描队列，凡 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t - t_0 &gt; W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 的事件立即移除，绝不留到「万一以后有用」。留着过期输入最典型的事故是：玩家在一次长动画开始时随手按了跳，动画播了半秒结束，若跳跃事件的窗没及时过期，角色会在动画一结束就「自己跳起来」，玩家完全不知为何。</p>\n<p>其二，<strong>消费即清</strong>。被 <code>consume</code> 的事件要立刻失效（或移除），否则同一次按键会在后续帧被再次匹配，造成「按一次跳两下」的经典误触发。consumed 标记与过期检查是防误触发的两道闸，<a href=\"input-priority\">输入优先级</a>在多候选并存时还要加第三道——决定同一时刻先消费谁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>缓冲时间窗是附着在事件上的滑动有效期，判定即检查窗口内是否存在未消费、未过期的目标动作事件；跳跃缓冲向未来延伸，土狼时间向过去延伸，二者对称互补。</li>\n<li>单位上「固定步长里用帧、对外配置用秒」：设计师以秒思考，系统换算成帧做确定性判定。</li>\n<li>必须一动作一窗：跳跃等高频低风险动作给长窗求跟手，消耗型大招给极短窗或不缓冲以防误放；SF6 的 QCF≈11 帧、半圈 12 帧、全圈 32 帧印证「越复杂指令给越长容错」。</li>\n<li>过期即清、消费即清是防「旧输入还魂」和「一按两跳」的两道闸，缺一即出诡异 bug。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"input-queue\">输入队列</a>、<a href=\"input-priority\">输入优先级</a>（本 hub 兄弟篇）</li>\n<li>参数取值实操：<a href=\"../practice/feel-tuning\">手感调校</a>；向过去延伸的对称机制：<a href=\"../leniency/coyote-time\">土狼时间</a>（本 hub 兄弟篇）</li>\n<li>跨库：帧数据（起手/恢复帧）如何与缓冲窗协同，见 <a href=\"../../combat-system-design/foundations/action-states-frame-data\">32_combat-system-design / 动作状态与帧数据</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缓冲时间窗：让输入有保质期","id":"缓冲时间窗-让输入有保质期"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一个滑动的有效期","id":"核心概念-一个滑动的有效期"},{"level":2,"text":"帧还是秒：单位之争","id":"帧还是秒-单位之争"},{"level":2,"text":"一动作一窗：为何不能全局一个值","id":"一动作一窗-为何不能全局一个值"},{"level":2,"text":"过期与清理：别让旧输入还魂","id":"过期与清理-别让旧输入还魂"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"输入队列：缓冲系统的承载体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-input-buffering-systems/buffering/input-queue"},"next":{"title":"输入优先级：多个候选时先执行谁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-input-buffering-systems/buffering/input-priority"}}